# Privacy Policy

AwakeBar does not collect, store, transmit, or share personal data.

All functionality operates locally on the user's Mac.

AwakeBar does not use analytics, tracking, advertising SDKs, or third-party data collection services.

AwakeBar does not request Accessibility permission and does not use Accessibility APIs.

AwakeBar does not create synthetic keyboard, mouse, cursor, or user-input events.

AwakeBar uses a standard macOS display wakefulness assertion while a user-controlled session is active.
